674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AApUdw6T4NYQ7kNvwGJZ7A5&_nc_oc=Ado8f7e4vnb1eBngDdlxgFccTr4qERTS9i8U-Tn4OTgm9GMrp92-_dO5YLHXMRwSgig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAhFLkE8jt1KsVy6sIuVppXSHe7ChO7sI5I3LPLkYbshw&oe=6A68BD59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4NhqVIOtAH4Q7kNvwE28TlJ&_nc_oc=AdqJkI5fgQ0VkXYhq3jcALYRno0O4MnXLnEKrGdqYH1fuTWLrzxKPb-IB7drpLCehqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDe42VJt9KHM9lf_EzPKNeMgoEaHzu_GI725xer3XUZng&oe=6A68C616"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0rTDuYlPsKcQ7kNvwENGiPU&_nc_oc=Adq0rtixxqaED01_n9gHx92bwPLbd95xEpUaTHbFqgU5kk5kqdDFF23Z9AlRuA9wgHU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAoO82egLNn1uRxk1778etm0UAoytASw03jSY0gHghsTw&oe=6A68C231"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip